      "side": 1,
      "message": "That\u0027s how I originally had this but then decided to go with separate field definitions. Obviously a cleared buffer is intended to be bound to some GPU operation but I didn\u0027t want any future changes to the BindBufferInfo definition to impact the contract for clearing a buffer. Another motivation was that a clear task could possibly take a shared pointer to a buffer in the future, so managing these two Info structs separately felt cleaner to me.\n\nI\u0027m happy to go in either direction if you disagree.",
